id: pm-gh1388
title: "GH-1388: Expose every declared blocker and its live status in default item reads"
description: Default get retains a compatibility scalar but supplies no live status for the complete declared blocker set. Resolve declared references with the shared actionability SDK primitives without enumerating unrelated items.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-04T11:45:35.406Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T14:09:13.911Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-04T14:09:10.729Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-04T14:09:10.729Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Default current reads expose all unresolved declared blockers plus a resolved count; Unknown and external references remain unresolved; Custom terminal statuses use the runtime registry; Explicit and historical projections remain truthful and recoverable.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Trustworthy bounded context and SDK-owned evidence
value: Agents can act on one truthful context read and preserve durable evidence
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "SDK get resolves all declared local blockers, canonicalizes aliases once, retains unknown/external references, refuses unsafe identity paths, omits misleading default scalar and edge attribution, and preserves full/explicit restoration without historical status claims."
expected_result: "One bounded current read answers which declared prerequisites remain unresolved, while full or selected reads preserve stored compatibility and provenance."
actual_result: "48 focused query/receipt and 47 persistence tests pass, thirteen safe/source-defect controls are assertion-sensitive, 32 token surfaces retain original limits, and freshly packed Node/Bun consumers each pass 14 CLI operations plus public SDK/npx/bunx and strict history. Exact final-head hosted checks and refreshed bot admission are required before PR1395 merge."
affected_version: 2026.10.4
